OL,3,GNEWSACash boost 'transformational' for 
OL,4,Aarts hub project                       
OL,6,FA #228,000 grant will be               
OL,7,F"transformational" for a group wanting 
OL,8,Fto convert a historic Bradford building
OL,9,Finto a community hub and arts space,   
OL,10,Faccording to one of its directors.     
OL,12,FHarry Jelley is a board member for the 
OL,13,Fnon-profit People's Property Portfolio 
OL,14,F(PPP) which bought the former Quaker   
OL,15,Fschool in the city's Little Germany    
OL,16,Fdistrict a year ago.                   
OL,18,FThe PPP has been awarded a National    
OL,19,FLottery Heritage Fund (NLHF)           
OL,20,Fdevelopment grant to pay for           
OL,21,Farchitectural and conservation work,   
OL,22,Fincluding specialist surveys.          
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
