OL,3,GNEWSACash boost 'transformational' for 
OL,4,Aarts hub project                       
OL,6,FIt would also allow the group to       
OL,7,Fcontinue its efforts to raise an       
OL,8,Festimated #3m to complete the project, 
OL,9,Fsaid Jelley.                           
